WEBVTT

00:05:26.596 --> 00:05:30.316
And it clearly states what has to be done

00:05:30.356 --> 00:05:32.196
by whom, when,

00:05:32.196 --> 00:05:36.396
and, where relevant, at what
necessary budgetary cost.

00:05:37.076 --> 00:05:40.196
Let me give you one example.

00:05:40.236 --> 00:05:42.516
In 2022,

00:05:42.556 --> 00:05:48.236
the city council decided to invest
in a carbon capture and storage facility

00:05:48.276 --> 00:05:51.956
at the largest waste
incineration plant in Oslo.

00:05:51.996 --> 00:05:56.636
This is the single biggest
emission source in Oslo,

00:05:56.676 --> 00:06:00.316
accounting for 17 percent of the total.